ple tag","The underlined '123 מקור / 123 חושב / 123 הוזנה' at the top","The red box with 'שאלה פתוחה'","יתרת זכות"],"not_found":["An actual amount for what my bank charges me each month","A plain answer on what is as safe as a deposit and pays more","Which bank pays interest on the עו\"ש"],"findings":[{"what":"The cost section gives no number, only 'לפי התעריפון של הגורם המציע'","where":"כמה זה עולה, screen 4"},{"what":"The calculator assumes 5% return on a current account, which contradicts the text saying there's often no interest; the big 74,044 ₪ is misleading","where":"Calculator, screens 1-2"},{"what":"'אין ביטוח פיקדונות' is alarming with no reassurance about ordinary deposits","where":"שווה לדעת and סיכונים, screens 3 and 5"},{"what":"Codes like BANK-20 and TXI OQ11 mean nothing to me","where":"Screens 3 and 5"},{"what":"Small grey text on a black background is hard to read","where":"Calculator notes and table headers"},{"what":"The alternative offered (קרן כספית) is never explained in plain words","where":"Top of screen 3"},{"what":"A site I don't know (מקור); I'm not sure who stands behind it","where":"Header"},{"what":"The red box with 'שאלה פתוחה' made me back away","where":"Top of screen 5"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3837,"cache_read_input_tokens":11576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3837},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df63554b-2a81-41e4-bfb4-680d0fe6511f","uuid":"d710f197-b2e5-4580-9608-0cb57184504a","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:05:47.623Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeKGpKyxGbUHLKsvr2S","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Df1LrHaSMf5jY7BJJN9NMV":{"answer":"I didn't decide anything; I'll ask the bank whether they owe